---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const userStorage = [
  { label: t('用户一', 'User 1'), home: '97.1 GiB', docker: '10.7 GiB', total: '107.8 GiB', share: '24.7%' },
  { label: t('用户二', 'User 2'), home: '59.0 GiB', docker: '6.81 GiB', total: '65.8 GiB', share: '15.1%' },
  { label: t('用户三', 'User 3'), home: '17.1 GiB', docker: '5.13 GiB', total: '22.2 GiB', share: '5.1%' },
  { label: t('用户四', 'User 4'), home: '13.6 GiB', docker: '1.69 GiB', total: '15.3 GiB', share: '3.5%' },
  { label: t('用户五', 'User 5'), home: '4.42 GiB', docker: '3.39 GiB', total: '7.81 GiB', share: '1.8%' },
  { label: t('用户六', 'User 6'), home: '2.85 GiB', docker: '0.29 GiB', total: '3.14 GiB', share: '0.7%' },
  { label: t('用户七', 'User 7'), home: '<0.01 GiB', docker: '<0.01 GiB', total: '<0.01 GiB', share: '<0.1%' },
];

const refreshPrompt = t(
  `请执行一次“共享实验服务器科研资产整理、上传与空间回收”。

目标页面：https://basemodel-preview.vercel.app/research/seed-openevo/flow/server/
仓库：mykcs/basemodel

开始前，请完整读取并严格执行：
docs/agents/current/server-artifact-governance-and-reclaim-sop.md

这份 Markdown 是本任务的详细执行方案和验收标准。不要只给我一个计划；凡是当前权限和既有 policy 已经允许、且不需要新的科学/可见性/不可逆人类决策的步骤，请实际执行到闭环。

你将依次完成：
1. 读取当前服务器/项目 authority，做低 I/O 的 live 空间与活跃引用盘点；
2. 对准备触碰的每个对象证明 ownership / lineage。OpenEvo、checkpoint、容器或镜像“名字看起来像我们的”一律不算证据；归属不闭合就 HOLD；
3. 按现有 Run Manifest / artifact manifest 标准给有科学意义的 run、checkpoint、trajectory、analysis/report、evaluation output、runtime 等补齐“身份证”，并输出 coverage receipt；
4. 查重后按语义上传/复用：代码、配置、small evidence/manifest → GitHub；checkpoint/adapter → Hugging Face model repo；大 trajectory/analysis data → 合适的 HF dataset/private staging；OCI runtime → GHCR；W&B 只作为 telemetry/cross-link，不当唯一备份；
5. 对每个远端对象记录 immutable revision/digest/hash，并做 fresh read/download/reload/restore 验证；上传成功本身不等于可删除；
6. 把本地对象分成 P0_ACTIVE / P1_ANALYSIS_HOLD / P2_ARCHIVE_THEN_RECLAIM / P3_REBUILDABLE / X_SHARED_OR_UNKNOWN，并保护 active、analysis hold、hot-recovery、shared/unknown 对象；
7. 生成 exact reclaim manifest（初始 NOT_AUTHORIZED）和技术版/通俗版报告。未知删除清单不被这条 Prompt 预授权；到这个唯一不可逆 gate 时，请让我批准 exact manifest；批准后重新检查 liveness/ownership，再精确删除，禁止 shared Docker broad prune；
8. 删除后分别记录 logical deleted bytes 和 df 实测变化；最后刷新中英文 BaseModel server 页面，若跨用户归属无法在不越权的情况下完整重算，就只刷新全盘 current snapshot，并把最近一次完整匿名归属快照明确标成历史，不允许用部分数据伪装成新排行；
9. 跑 deterministic tests、build、overflow/UI/browser acceptance，开 PR，验 exact-head Preview，合并并检查最终 Vercel 页面。

最终请交付：inventory/ownership 汇总、身份证覆盖率、GitHub/HF/GHCR 发布与复用清单、每个远端 immutable revision/digest + restore 结果、protected/HOLD 清单、exact reclaim manifest 与实际回收字节、更新后的服务器快照、PR/merge commit/Preview/Production 验收结果。`,
  `Run one end-to-end shared experiment-server artifact governance, publication, and space-reclaim pass.

Target page: https://basemodel-preview.vercel.app/research/seed-openevo/flow/server/
Repository: mykcs/basemodel

Before acting, read and strictly follow:
docs/agents/current/server-artifact-governance-and-reclaim-sop.md

That Markdown is the detailed execution plan and acceptance contract. Do not stop at a plan: execute every step already authorized by current policy until a genuine scientific, visibility, authority, or irreversible human gate is reached.

You will:
1. read current authority and take a low-I/O live storage/liveness snapshot;
2. prove ownership/lineage for every object you may touch. A name containing OpenEvo, checkpoint, a familiar container/image tag, or a project-like path is zero ownership evidence; unresolved ownership is HOLD;
3. build or repair canonical run/artifact passports for meaningful runs, checkpoints, trajectories, analysis/reports, evaluation outputs, runtimes, and related evidence, then report passport coverage;
4. deduplicate and route artifacts by semantics: code/config/small evidence/manifests to GitHub; checkpoints/adapters to a Hugging Face model repo; large trajectories/analysis data to an appropriate HF dataset/private staging area; OCI runtimes to GHCR; W&B is telemetry/cross-linking, not the only backup;
5. record immutable remote revisions/digests/hashes and perform fresh read/download/reload/restore verification. Upload success alone never makes a local copy deletable;
6. classify local material as P0_ACTIVE / P1_ANALYSIS_HOLD / P2_ARCHIVE_THEN_RECLAIM / P3_REBUILDABLE / X_SHARED_OR_UNKNOWN and protect active, analysis-hold, hot-recovery, shared, and unknown state;
7. produce an exact reclaim manifest (initially NOT_AUTHORIZED) plus technical and plain-language reports. This prompt does not pre-authorize an unknown deletion list. Stop only at that irreversible gate for approval of the exact manifest; after approval, re-check liveness/ownership and delete precisely. Never use broad shared-Docker prune;
8. record logical deleted bytes separately from the observed df change, then refresh both BaseModel server locales. If cross-user attribution cannot be recomputed completely without crossing authority/privacy boundaries, refresh the current global snapshot and keep the last complete anonymous attribution explicitly historical rather than fabricating a partial new ranking;
9. run deterministic tests, build, overflow/UI/browser acceptance, open a PR, verify the exact-head Preview, merge, and verify the final Vercel page.

Final delivery: inventory/ownership summary, passport coverage, GitHub/HF/GHCR publish/reuse matrix, immutable remote revisions/digests plus restore results, protected/HOLD set, exact reclaim manifest and actual reclaimed bytes, refreshed server snapshot, PR/merge commit, Preview, and Production acceptance.`
);

const gpuFacts = [
  { k: t('GPU 数量', 'GPU count'), v: '8 × RTX 5090' },
  { k: t('代际 / 架构', 'Generation / architecture'), v: 'GeForce RTX 50 · Blackwell' },
  { k: t('CUDA 核', 'CUDA cores'), v: '21,760 / GPU · 174,080 total' },
  { k: t('显存', 'VRAM'), v: '32,607 MiB / GPU · ≈ 254.7 GiB total' },
  { k: 'Compute Capability', v: '12.0' },
  { k: t('驱动快照', 'Driver snapshot'), v: '610.57.04' },
];
---
<main class="server-overview" data-locale={locale}>
  <header class="server-hero">
    <div class="server-hero__eyebrow">{t('OpenEvo / WebShop · 实验服务器', 'OpenEvo / WebShop · experiment server')}</div>
    <h1>{t('实验服务器简介', 'Experiment server overview')}</h1>
    <p>{t('2026-09-04 13:46（UTC+8）的安全快照显示，这台机器仍为 2 × Intel Xeon Platinum 8380、约 1.0 TiB 内存，并可见 8 × RTX 5090。主文件系统当前约有 16.5 GiB 可用、df 报 97% 使用率；磁盘空间仍是最紧张的资源。', 'The safe 2026-09-04 13:46 (UTC+8) snapshot still shows 2 × Intel Xeon Platinum 8380 CPUs, about 1.0 TiB RAM, and 8 visible RTX 5090 GPUs. The main filesystem has about 16.5 GiB available and df reports 97% used, so disk capacity remains the tightest resource.')}</p>
    <div class="snapshot-note">
      <strong>{t('数据时间', 'Data timestamp')}</strong>
      <span>2026-09-04 13:46 (UTC+8)</span>
      <span>{t('静态快照，不是实时监控面板', 'Static snapshot, not a live monitoring dashboard')}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="priority-grid" aria-label={t('关键资源', 'Key resources')}>
    <article class="priority-card priority-card--attention">
      <span>{t('磁盘剩余', 'Disk free')}</span>
      <strong>16.5 GiB</strong>
      <h2>{t('主文件系统可用空间', 'Main filesystem available')}</h2>
      <p>{t('本次全盘快照中，df 报告 97% 已使用。当前只剩约 16.5 GiB 普通可写空间，因此整理、归档与精确 reclaim 的优先级很高。', 'In this global snapshot, df reports 97% used with only about 16.5 GiB available to ordinary writes, so artifact governance, archival, and precise reclaim are high priority.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="priority-card">
      <span>GPU</span>
      <strong>8 × 5090</strong>
      <h2>GeForce RTX 50 · Blackwell</h2>
      <p>{t('每张约 31.8 GiB 显存。8 张卡的显存不能自动当成一张 254.7 GiB 的大卡，是否能合并使用取决于并行策略。', 'Each GPU has about 31.8 GiB VRAM. Eight GPUs do not automatically behave like one 254.7 GiB GPU; usable aggregate memory depends on the parallelism strategy.')}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="priority-card">
      <span>CPU</span>
      <strong>80 / 160</strong>
      <h2>{t('80 个物理核 · 160 个逻辑线程', '80 physical cores · 160 logical threads')}</h2>
      <p>2 × Intel Xeon Platinum 8380 @ 2.30 GHz · 40 {t('核/路', 'cores/socket')} · 2 {t('线程/核', 'threads/core')}</p>
    </article>
    <article class="priority-card">
      <span>RAM</span>
      <strong>1.0 TiB</strong>
      <h2>{t('内存容量', 'System memory')}</h2>
      <p>{t('快照时约 82.9 GiB 正在使用，Linux 报告约 909.2 GiB available；RAM 仍远比磁盘宽裕。', 'At the snapshot, about 82.9 GiB was in use and Linux reported about 909.2 GiB available; RAM remains far less constrained than disk.')}</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>01</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('存储', 'Storage')}</small>
        <h2>{t('磁盘使用情况', 'Filesystem usage')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('主文件系统总容量约 436.0 GiB。2026-09-04 13:46（UTC+8）实测已用约 397.3 GiB，df 报 97% 使用率，普通写入约剩 16.5 GiB。下面先显示今天可安全刷新的一致全盘事实；跨用户容量归属仍保留最近一次完整匿名快照，不为了刷新网页越过同学的权限边界。', 'The main filesystem has about 436.0 GiB total capacity. At 2026-09-04 13:46 (UTC+8), about 397.3 GiB was used, df reported 97%, and about 16.5 GiB remained available to ordinary writes. The first block shows today’s safely refreshable global facts; cross-user attribution remains the most recent complete anonymous snapshot rather than crossing sibling-user boundaries just to refresh the page.')}</p>

    <div class="storage-status">
      <div class="storage-status__numbers">
        <div><span>{t('文件系统', 'Filesystem')}</span><strong>436.0 GiB</strong></div>
        <div><span>{t('已用', 'Used')}</span><strong>397.3 GiB</strong></div>
        <div><span>{t('可用', 'Available')}</span><strong>16.5 GiB</strong></div>
        <div><span>df Use%</span><strong>97%</strong></div>
      </div>
      <div class="storage-bar" role="img" aria-label={t('2026-09-04 13:46（UTC+8）主文件系统：总容量 436.0 GiB；已用 397.3 GiB；普通可用 16.5 GiB；文件系统保留与舍入约 22.2 GiB。', '2026-09-04 13:46 (UTC+8) main filesystem: 436.0 GiB total; 397.3 GiB used; 16.5 GiB available to ordinary writes; about 22.2 GiB filesystem reserve/rounding.')}>
        <span class="storage-bar__used" style="width:91.1%"></span>
        <span class="storage-bar__free" style="width:3.8%"></span>
        <span class="storage-bar__reserved" style="width:5.1%"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="storage-legend">
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--used"></i><span>{t('当前已用', 'Current used')}</span><strong>397.3 GiB · 91.1%</strong></div>
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--free"></i><span>{t('普通可用', 'Available')}</span><strong>16.5 GiB · 3.8%</strong></div>
        <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--reserved"></i><span>{t('文件系统保留 / 舍入', 'Filesystem reserve / rounding')}</span><strong>22.2 GiB · 5.1%</strong></div>
      </div>
      <p class="fine-print">{t('这里的 91.1% 是 used / total 的物理拆分比例；df 的 97% 使用率使用的是普通用户可用空间语义，因此两者不需要相等。所有 current 数字来自 2026-09-04 13:46（UTC+8）的 live df。', 'The 91.1% segment is the physical used/total share; df’s 97% follows ordinary-user available-space semantics, so the two percentages need not match. All current figures here come from the live 2026-09-04 13:46 (UTC+8) df snapshot.')}</p>

      <div class="attribution-history">
        <div class="snapshot-subhead">
          <div><strong>{t('最近一次完整匿名归属拆分', 'Most recent complete anonymous attribution')}</strong><span>2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8)</span></div>
          <p>{t('今天没有为了重算排行榜去进入同学容器或借助 Docker 管理能力挂载同学 home。所以下面的归属拆分明确保留为昨天的完整快照，而不是拿部分数据伪装成今天的排行。', 'Today’s refresh did not enter sibling-user containers or use Docker-admin capability to mount sibling homes merely to recompute the ranking. The attribution split below therefore remains explicitly the last complete snapshot instead of presenting partial data as a fresh ranking.')}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="storage-bar" role="img" aria-label={t('2026-09-03 01:11（UTC+8）完整匿名归属快照：可按账户归属 222.0 GiB；未归属 Docker 写入层 19.0 GiB；共享/系统占用 147.7 GiB；当时可用 25.1 GiB；文件系统保留/舍入 22.2 GiB。', 'Complete anonymous attribution snapshot from 2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8): 222.0 GiB account-attributed; 19.0 GiB unattributed Docker writable layers; 147.7 GiB shared/system usage; 25.1 GiB then available; 22.2 GiB filesystem reserve/rounding.')}>
          <span class="storage-bar__users" style="width:50.9%"></span>
          <span class="storage-bar__docker" style="width:4.4%"></span>
          <span class="storage-bar__shared" style="width:33.9%"></span>
          <span class="storage-bar__free" style="width:5.7%"></span>
          <span class="storage-bar__reserved" style="width:5.1%"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="storage-legend">
          <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--users"></i><span>{t('可按账户归属', 'Account-attributed')}</span><strong>222.0 GiB · 50.9%</strong></div>
          <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--docker"></i><span>{t('未归属 Docker 写入层', 'Unattributed Docker writable layers')}</span><strong>19.0 GiB · 4.4%</strong></div>
          <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--shared"></i><span>{t('共享 / 系统占用', 'Shared / system usage')}</span><strong>147.7 GiB · 33.9%</strong></div>
          <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--free"></i><span>{t('当时可用', 'Available then')}</span><strong>25.1 GiB · 5.7%</strong></div>
          <div><i class="legend-swatch legend-swatch--reserved"></i><span>{t('文件系统保留 / 舍入', 'Filesystem reserve / rounding')}</span><strong>22.2 GiB · 5.1%</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-df">
        <strong>{t('归属不能靠名字猜', 'Ownership cannot be guessed from names')}</strong>
        <p>{t('这台服务器上多人同时做 OpenEvo。文件名、run 名、容器名、Docker tag 或“看起来像某个实验”的路径都只是线索，不是 ownership 证据。清理前必须把 filesystem / run manifest / Git / container reference / artifact digest 等证据闭合；归属不清就 HOLD。', 'Multiple people run OpenEvo on this server. File names, run names, container names, Docker tags, or paths that look like a particular experiment are clues, not ownership evidence. Before cleanup, filesystem, run-manifest, Git, container-reference, artifact-digest, and related provenance must close the loop; unresolved ownership is HOLD.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>02</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('账户占用', 'Account usage')}</small>
        <h2>{t('各用户磁盘占用', 'Disk usage by account')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('下面保留的是 2026-09-03 01:11（UTC+8）最近一次完整匿名归属快照：每个账户的“可归属合计” = 主目录 + 能通过当时完整证据可靠归属的 Docker 写入层。今天没有跨越同学权限边界重算，因此不要把这张表理解成 2026-09-04 的实时排行。', 'The table below is the most recent complete anonymous attribution snapshot from 2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8). Each attributable total combines the home directory with Docker writable layers that were reliably attributable under that complete evidence set. Today’s refresh did not cross sibling-user authority boundaries to recompute it, so this is not a live 2026-09-04 ranking.')}</p>
    <div class="storage-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label={t('匿名账户磁盘占用表', 'Anonymized account disk-usage table')} tabindex="0">
      <table class="storage-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">{t('账户', 'Account')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('主目录', 'Home directory')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('Docker 写入层', 'Docker writable layers')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('可归属合计', 'Attributable total')}</th>
            <th scope="col">{t('全盘占比', 'Share of filesystem')}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {userStorage.map((item) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row">{item.label}</th>
              <td>{item.home}</td>
              <td>{item.docker}</td>
              <td><strong>{item.total}</strong></td>
              <td>{item.share}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">{t('用户一到七是 2026-09-03 01:11（UTC+8）快照中按“可归属合计”从大到小重新生成的临时匿名标签，不是公开身份，也不会跨快照保持同一个编号。网页不保存真实账户与匿名编号之间的对应关系。', 'Users 1–7 are temporary anonymous labels regenerated from attributable-total ranking in the complete 2026-09-03 01:11 (UTC+8) attribution snapshot. They are not public identities and the numbering does not persist across snapshots. The page does not store the mapping between real accounts and anonymous labels.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>03</span>
      <div>
        <small>GPU</small>
        <h2>{t('GPU 规格', 'GPU specifications')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('RTX 5090 属于 GeForce RTX 50 系列，采用 Blackwell 架构。单卡 21,760 个 CUDA 核，显存 32,607 MiB，Compute Capability 为 12.0。', 'RTX 5090 belongs to the GeForce RTX 50 series and uses the Blackwell architecture. Each GPU has 21,760 CUDA cores, 32,607 MiB VRAM, and Compute Capability 12.0.')}</p>
    <dl class="gpu-facts">
      {gpuFacts.map((item) => <div><dt>{item.k}</dt><dd>{item.v}</dd></div>)}
    </dl>
    <div class="gpu-note">
      <strong>{t('多卡性能说明', 'Multi-GPU performance note')}</strong>
      <p>{t('8 张卡 × 21,760 CUDA 核可以得到整机 174,080 CUDA 核这个“规格总和”，但训练速度不会简单变成单卡的 8 倍。数据并行、模型并行、通信和显存分配都会决定实际收益。', 'Eight cards × 21,760 CUDA cores gives a hardware-spec total of 174,080 CUDA cores, but training does not automatically become eight times faster. Data/model parallelism, communication, and memory placement determine the real gain.')}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>04</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('快捷操作', 'Quick action')}</small>
        <h2>{t('整理、上传与清理服务器空间', 'Govern, publish, and reclaim server artifacts')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-lede">{t('当你准备整理服务器时，复制下面这段 Prompt 到一个能够操作服务器与相关远端仓库的 ChatGPT / Codex 对话。它会先读取一份详细 Markdown，然后按“盘点 → 身份证 → 上传/验证 → 精确 reclaim → 网页刷新”执行；未知删除清单仍只在 exact manifest 处向你确认一次。', 'When you are ready to organize the server, copy this prompt into a ChatGPT/Codex conversation that can operate the server and relevant remotes. It first reads a detailed Markdown contract, then runs inventory → passports → publish/verify → precise reclaim → webpage refresh; an unknown deletion list still pauses once at the exact-manifest approval gate.')}</p>
    <div class="prompt-summary" aria-label={t('这次会做什么', 'What this workflow does')}>
      <div><strong>{t('整理', 'Organize')}</strong><span>{t('盘点、归属证明、P0/P1/P2/P3/X 分类', 'Inventory, ownership proof, P0/P1/P2/P3/X classification')}</span></div>
      <div><strong>{t('身份证', 'Passport')}</strong><span>{t('Run Manifest + artifact digest / lineage / restore 信息', 'Run Manifest + artifact digest / lineage / restore identity')}</span></div>
      <div><strong>{t('上传', 'Publish')}</strong><span>{t('GitHub / Hugging Face / GHCR 按语义路由并 fresh verify', 'Route to GitHub / Hugging Face / GHCR and fresh-verify')}</span></div>
      <div><strong>{t('清理', 'Reclaim')}</strong><span>{t('exact manifest 授权后精确删除，并实测 df', 'Precise deletion after exact-manifest approval, then measured df')}</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="refresh-prompt">
      <pre data-copy-label={t('复制服务器整理 Prompt', 'Copy server-governance prompt')}><code>{refreshPrompt}</code></pre>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="server-section server-section--privacy">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span>05</span>
      <div>
        <small>{t('隐私边界', 'Privacy boundary')}</small>
        <h2>{t('资源归属与隐私', 'Usage attribution and privacy')}</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="privacy-grid">
